<p><a href="u">n</a></p>
<p><a href="u`">m</a> and <a href="`v">m</a> and <a href="w">n</a></p>
```

```
x{*$`a*} here

x{~$$`b~} here

x{/!`c/} here

x{_!`d`_} here
.
<p>x{*<span class="math inline" role="math">\(a*} here\)</span></p>
<p>x{~<span class="math display" role="math">\[b~} here\]</span></p>
<p>x{/c/} here</p>
<p>x<u>d</u> here</p>
```

